  "invariants": [
    "Provider principal/offboarding plus operating policy and current Directory is the canonical effective authority. Automatic active-MRN-staff access remains; no per-person onboarding/approval or new credential.",
    "Owner assertion is independently authenticated identity proof bound to pinned service/current connection/policy; verify assigned owner, primary identity, current Directory and nonce. Signed verified_owner is not a worker-selected actor. Only revoke; no grant, enroll, role change or identity replacement.",
    "Resolve opaque principal key hash against authoritative retained identity, never caller email/sub. Preserve identity or create only a revocation tombstone. Monotonic gateway revision/intent is locked and audited with principal/authority; acknowledge effective denial only after exact readback.",
    "Gateway denies and records pending before propagation. Uncertain/failed propagation remains pending and vetoes protected work; provider absence cannot be treated as successful mirror.",
    "Provider independently reads original sealed job requester and checks current roles/Directory/principal/policy/source/expiry at every protected boundary. Advisory worker check cannot supply or renew a human lease.",
    "Fixed private gateway veto lookup is nonce/check/job/phase/requester/scope/policy-bound, purpose-signed by pinned identity authority, at most five seconds old, one-use, monotonic revision and no positive cache. It can only veto; clear never grants authority.",
    "Pending/denied/unavailable/old/replayed/wrong-scope status aborts work. Veto and mirrored access-policy digest/epoch must be implemented before capture-read/report/publication activation.",
    "Recheck after network work/immediately before signing/storage. Effective revocation and final provider guard serialize on the same principal row; already guarded work may commit before revocation, so UI reports pending until propagation/readback, not instant cancellation.",
    "Replay/veto records are bounded per job; exhaustion fails closed. Terminal jobs never revive. No arbitrary service URL, actor reconstruction, retry, policy/key provisioning or production activation.",
    "Provider query is authoritative only after Gateway independently validates its stored one-use nonce/query through authenticated readback. Query/readback/veto expiry is at most five seconds; fresh worker assertion is at most sixty seconds.",
    "Committed owner outcome must bind exact principal key, intent, requested gateway revision and committed provider revision/readback digest; pending outcome must have committed_denial false and null commit/readback. The body alone cannot create effective revocation.",
    "Worker checks-clear requires reason none and current verified mapping/ledger; every failure is vetoed. execution_permit is always false. Server-side mapping is created only by the earlier authenticated human queue and verified provider response.",
    "Each running boundary uses a new registered query and fresh signed veto, including after a native call exceeds five seconds. Old/pre-dispatch receipt is discarded, never reused or extended. A pending response aborts before another packet or complete retention.",
    "Callback/lookup/validation timeout or expiry fails closed without retry/recapture/continuation. Source/job/capture and human lifetimes never extend.",
    "Isolated control ledger must be visible to authenticated readback during held work guard without releasing it or blocking on options-table gap locks. Missing implementation/isolation proof blocks activation."
  ],
  "query_readback_purpose_prefix": "mrn-mainwp-gateway-access-query-readback-v1:",
  "owner_readback_purpose_prefix": "mrn-mainwp-owner-revocation-readback-v1:",
  "handshake": {
    "direction": "Provider issues veto_query to protected caller in authenticated Dashboard HTTPS response; Gateway independently retrieves stored query from Dashboard before resolving its existing job map. No provider outbound credential is assumed.",
    "provider_origin": "https://wpcontrol.mrndev.io",
    "gateway_audience": "https://operations.mrnwebdesigns.com",
    "provider_transport_auth": "Existing pinned MainWP backend service connection, used only on the Dashboard origin; no cross-origin credential reuse.",
    "gateway_readback_auth": "Same existing pinned Dashboard service transport plus fresh purpose-signed assertion under pinned existing gateway identity-authority keys.",
    "veto_response_auth": "Fresh purpose-signed existing gateway identity-authority response, bound to exact stored query ID/nonce/digest/check/job/phase/requester/scope/policy/revision.",
    "gateway_resolution": "Existing immutable queue-created job-to-original-requester mapping only. Caller-supplied actor, hash or query cannot create a map. Unknown job, missing map/ledger, invalid readback or stale/pending/denied lookup fails closed.",
    "owner_response_auth": "Authenticated Dashboard HTTPS response and exact owner query/readback bindings; committed denial requires verified provider ledger revision/intent/current principal state. Uncertainty returns pending-uncertain, never effective success.",
    "no_execution_permit": "Worker result is advisory. Existing protected operations independently perform current provider and veto checks; receipt is not a lease.",
    "running_boundary_sequence": [
      "current provider role/Directory/principal/source/expiry checks",
      "new independently committed query ID/nonce in isolated control ledger",
      "fixed gateway query-ID callback without cross-origin credential",
      "gateway authenticated Dashboard readback and immutable job/requester lookup",
      "fresh signed veto response validation",
      "immediate five-second/capture deadline and owned-lock check",
      "sign/retain/commit one boundary only",
      "discard receipt after network work; new query before next boundary"
    ],
    "callback_direction": "Synchronous provider-to-compiled-gateway-origin opaque query-ID/nonce trigger. Gateway authenticates stored query through existing Dashboard service/readback and purpose-signed authority; response independently signed. No actor/context URL or credential forwarded.",
    "ledger_isolation": "Dedicated private control table and short autocommit connection on same Dashboard DB, independent of held work transaction/authority/principal/job/options gap locks. Separate committed-query readback only; no work COMMIT or unlock. Unimplemented mandatory isolation tests."
  },
